From 292c7810fe7e07130244fd274b13deee4cb56fe9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sudharsan Eswaran <eswaran@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Apr 2026 17:21:25 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] changes to parse 6G HE EHT capability

1. parse the EHT capability and get all supported op-class for 6GHz band
2. update the proper tx power by converting center channel number for higher BW
3. get the correct non-operable channel
4. Added `eht` to the PHY preference list for 2.4 GHz band
   changed from `{"he", "ht"}` to `{"eht", "he", "ht"}`
5. fix to properly read the 40Mhz BW via nl call

Signed-off-by: Sudharsan Eswaran <eswaran@qti.qualcomm.com>
